# AbacusCopilot

> ୧(๑•̀⌄•́๑)૭   A pre- & post-processing toolkit for the ABACUS DFT software

**AbacusCopilot** is a VASPKIT-style toolkit that streamlines working with ABACUS — generating input files, analyzing output, and producing publication-quality figures. It provides both an interactive menu-driven interface and a command-line task mode.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install
pip install -e .

# Launch interactive mode
abacuscopilot

# Run a task non-interactively
abacuscopilot -task 101                    # Generate SCF INPUT
abacuscopilot -task 201                    # Convert CIF → STRU
abacuscopilot -task 301                    # Generate KPT from k-spacing
abacuscopilot -task 721 --bands OUT.Si/BANDS_1.dat  # Plot band structure
abacuscopilot -task 711 --log OUT.ABACUS/running_scf.log  # SCF convergence
abacuscopilot --list-tasks                 # Show all available tasks
```

### First-time Setup

```bash
abacuscopilot -task 1    # Configuration wizard
```

Configures pseudopotential paths, orbital directories, ABACUS binary location, and default calculation parameters. Settings are saved to `~/.abacuscopilot/config.yaml`.

## Task Reference

### Pre-processing

| ID | Name | Description |
|----|------|-------------|
| 1 | System Setup | Configure pseudopotential paths, defaults |
| 2 | Show Config | Display current configuration |
| 3 | Check Environment | Verify tools and dependencies |
| 10 | Prepare Files | Copy PP/orbital files from library |
| 101 | SCF INPUT | Generate INPUT for SCF calculation |
| 102 | Relax INPUT | Generate INPUT for geometry relaxation |
| 103 | MD INPUT | Generate INPUT for molecular dynamics |
| 104 | Band Structure INPUT | Generate INPUT for band (NSCF) |
| 105 | DOS INPUT | Generate INPUT for DOS/PDOS |
| 106 | Work Function INPUT | Generate INPUT for work function |
| 201 | STRU from CIF | Convert CIF to ABACUS STRU |
| 202 | STRU from POSCAR | Convert VASP POSCAR to STRU |
| 203 | Coord Convert | Convert STRU between Direct and Cartesian |
| 204 | STRU to CIF | Convert STRU to CIF |
| 205 | STRU to POSCAR | Convert STRU to VASP POSCAR |
| 301 | Auto KPT (MP mesh) | Generate MP k-point mesh from k-spacing |
| 302 | KPT (band path) | Generate line-mode KPT for bands |
| 303 | Custom KPT | Custom k-point list |
| 401 | Build Supercell | Nx×Ny×Nz supercell |
| 402 | Redefine Lattice | Apply 3×3 transformation matrix |
| 403 | Coord Conversion | Direct ↔ Cartesian conversion |
| 404 | Fix/Unfix Atoms | Selective dynamics constraints |
| 405 | Slab Builder | Build slab from Miller indices |
| 406 | Vacuum Layer | Add vacuum along cell axis |
| 501 | Symmetry Analysis | Space group, Wyckoff positions |
| 502 | Primitive Cell | Reduce to primitive cell |

### Post-processing

| ID | Name | Description |
|----|------|-------------|
| 711 | SCF Convergence | Check SCF convergence history |
| 712 | SCF Compare | Compare multiple SCF runs |
| 713 | Calc Status | Check if calculation completed |
| 721 | Plot Band Structure | Band structure from BANDS_*.dat |
| 722 | Fat-band Plot | Projected (fat) band structure |
| 731 | Plot DOS | Total density of states |
| 732 | Plot PDOS | Projected density of states |
| 733 | DOS+Bands Combined | Side-by-side figure |
| 741 | 1D Planar Avg Charge | Planar-averaged charge density |
| 742 | Export Cube/XSF | Export for VESTA visualization |
| 743 | Diff. Charge Density | Δρ = ρ_AB − ρ_A − ρ_B |
| 751 | Elastic Constants | Parse elastic tensor, VRH moduli |
| 752 | EOS Fitting | Birch-Murnaghan equation of state |
| 771 | Work Function | Φ = V_vacuum − E_Fermi |
| 772 | Macroscopic Avg | Double-averaged potential |

## CLI Examples

```bash
# Generate all input files for a relaxation
abacuscopilot -task 201                    # STRU from CIF
abacuscopilot -task 102                    # Relax INPUT
abacuscopilot -task 301                    # Auto KPT
abacuscopilot -task 10                     # Copy PP/orbital files

# After calculation: analyze results
abacuscopilot -task 713                    # Check status
abacuscopilot -task 711                    # SCF convergence
abacuscopilot -task 721 --bands OUT.Si/BANDS_1.dat  # Band plot
abacuscopilot -task 731 --dos OUT.Si/DOS_1.dat      # DOS plot

# Output to a specific directory
abacuscopilot -task 101 -o ./my_calculation/

# Note: for flags with negative values, use = syntax
abacuscopilot -task 721 --erange=-5,5 --bands BANDS.dat
```

## Configuration

Edit `~/.abacuscopilot/config.yaml` or run `abacuscopilot -task 1`:

```yaml
libraries:
  pseudo_library: /path/to/pseudopotentials/
  orbital_library: /path/to/orbitals/

defaults:
  kspacing: 0.14
  ecutwfc: 100.0
  basis_type: lcao
  dft_functional: pbe
  scf_thr: 1e-7

plotting:
  dpi: 300
  figure_format: png
```

## Development

```bash
# Install dev dependencies
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run tests
python -m pytest tests/ -v

# Run specific test file
python -m pytest tests/test_io.py -v
```

### Adding a New Task

```python
from abacuscopilot.tasks import task

@task(9001, category="My Category", name="My Task",
      description="Description for CLI and menu")
def my_task(args=None, interactive=True):
    console = ...
    # task logic here
```

Tasks are auto-discovered from `abacuscopilot/preprocessing/` and `abacuscopilot/postprocessing/` packages.

